      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Pulse 84, blood pressure 138 over 88.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:10",
      "end_timestamp": "03:14",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Slightly raised, which fits with stress and the alcohol. Any breathlessness, chest pain?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:20",
      "end_timestamp": "03:28",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:30",
      "end_timestamp": "03:31",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right. Putting this together, irritability and outbursts for a year, poor sleep, a new baby, work stress and heavy-ish drinking, I'd say this is stress-related irritability, probably with sleep deprivation and alcohol feeding it.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:33",
      "end_timestamp": "03:50",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Nothing you've described points that way. But I'd like to check your thyroid and a few other things, because they can cause irritability.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:00",
      "end_timestamp": "04:11",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Cut the beer to a couple of units, not every night, and stop the St John's wort, it can interact with other things. Cut the coffee after midday.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:18",
      "end_timestamp": "04:34",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And I'd like you to try a short anger-management course, and talking therapy.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:39",
      "end_timestamp": "04:46",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It does, for most. I'd like to see you again in three weeks.",
